    <title>Vol.17 拧巴的自我观察记录</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/674a21b0c3b2a2f3347f1ceb</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">674a21b0c3b2a2f3347f1ceb</guid>
    <pubDate>Fri, 29 Nov 2024 20:33:06 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>我（锤子钉）自觉是一个性格比较拧巴的人，虽然本性难移，好在自己还能看得见问题在发生(´･_･`)</span></p><p><span>时间线：</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="112">01:52</a> 小时候为了买游戏掌机”发疯“</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="259">04:19</a> 长大了为了纠结买不买新手机“发疯”</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="344">05:44</a> 主观因为他人的评价出现了不遵从本心的选项</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="486">08:06</a> 客观因素和习惯</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="514">08:34</a> 自己很难打破舒适圈</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="575">09:35</a> 只看别人好的东西,看吃不看打</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="612">10:12</a> 拧巴和纠结的区别</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="666">11:06</a> 拧巴让自己舒服的原地踏步</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="760">12:40</a> 更关注感觉不像“平时的自己”的想法</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="799">13:19</a> 总结</span></p><p><span>扩展推荐：</span></p><p><a href="https://space.bilibili.com/339790766/channel/collectiondetail?sid=1813248" data-url="https://space.bilibili.com/339790766/channel/collectiondetail?sid=1813248"><span>斑马酱锵锵锵 合集·再见爱人3 Reaction</span></a></p><p><span>背景音乐：</span></p><p><span>Timber Hearth - Andrew Prahlow</span></p><p><span>Talk Show Host - Radiohead</span></p><p><span>音频剪辑：</span></p><p><span>锤子钉</span></p><p><span>封面制作：</span></p><p><span>锤子钉</span></p>]]></description>
