    <title>Vol.13 在家躺出来的佛系心态</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/661ed15e48c40e2fb0c56bb4</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">661ed15e48c40e2fb0c56bb4</guid>
    <pubDate>Tue, 16 Apr 2024 19:28:29 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>我（锤子钉）贸然开始了自己的离职生活，虽然好像浪费了大把的时间，但是现在重新看看自己的状态甚至觉得还不错( ´▽` )ﾉ</span></p><p><span>时间线：</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="30">00:30</a> 离职的原因</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="140">02:20</a> “中年焦虑”</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="275">04:35</a> 只需要重新走起来</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="360">06:00</a> 如何看待死亡</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="438">07:18</a> 我应该做什么</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="605">10:05</a> 随想见闻</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="675">11:15</a> 总结</span></p><p><span>背景音乐：</span></p><p><span>Timber Hearth - Andrew Prahlow</span></p><p><span>ilya - In Love With a Ghost</span></p><p><span>音频剪辑：</span></p><p><span>锤子钉</span></p><p><span>封面制作：</span></p><p><span>锤子钉</span></p>]]></description>
